// fleetDownAfter is how long the fleet health plane must go without reporting
// an endpoint HEALTHY or DEGRADED before readiness counts it down. Reports go
// stale or UNHEALTHY for a few seconds at a time on an otherwise idle fleet.
const fleetDownAfter = 30 * time.Second

// absentPollsBeforeClose is how many health snapshots in a row must omit an
// endpoint before the pool closes it. The poller runs every 5s, so this is the
// same 30s as fleetDownAfter: one missed or partial snapshot keeps the
// connection, and readiness, through it.
const absentPollsBeforeClose = 6

